  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Dunno what you guys did but dynamic bones are now pretty broken on newly uploaded models. After uploading a new avatar I noticed its hair kept vibrating and jittering. It was slow and subtle at first when I changed into the avatar, but over time it keeps ramping up, until my hair was going absolutely nuts and vibrating and jittering all over the place as seen in this gif: https://i.gyazo.com/15b3a9fc56dc761c6f90e6e4bae0758b.mp4\n\nTo make absolutely sure it wasn't something on my end and is a bug with VRChat, I re-uploaded an avatar that was working absolutely fine with no issues. Once it was re-uploaded, it too started vibrating and jittering.\n\nI didn't change anything or update anything in regards to Unity or dynamic bones. I have the latest 1.2.0 version of dynamic bones as well. Nothing was changed on my end, so I can only assume this is a VRChat issue.\n\npls fix, I need my fluffy hair.\n\nEDIT: With full body tracking I barely notice this issue, but when going back to regular tracking and desktop is when it gets bad. ",
